LOGICLE / BIEXPONENTIAL TRANSFORM — PATENT NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------
The logicle (biexponential) display transform implemented in
packages/cytometry-core/src/transforms/logicle.ts derives from the Moore & Parks
reference implementation:

  Moore WA, Parks DR. "Update for the logicle data scale including operational
  code implementations." Cytometry Part A 2012; 81A(4):273-277.
  doi:10.1002/cyto.a.22030.  © Board of Trustees, Leland Stanford Junior
  University (BSD-style license).

The logicle method is covered by US Patent 6,954,722 (Parks DR, Moore WA;
issued Oct 11, 2005). Stanford's Office of Technology Licensing states that
"Stanford will not assert U.S. patent 6,954,722 in the field of flow cytometry."
This implementation is for flow cytometry. Anyone redistributing joeee for use
outside flow cytometry should obtain independent legal review.

VALIDATION ORACLE
-----------------
Transforms, compensation, and gating are validated against flowutils (the
FlowKit logicle C extension; BSD-3-Clause, © 2019 Scott White), which derives
from the same Moore-Parks reference. See docs/VALIDATION.md.
